# Output of `cargo run -p wgcore --example demo` -- these are *real*
# generated WireGuard private keys. Never commit generated .conf files or
# project.json files; if you want example/fixture configs in the repo,
# keep them in a clearly-labeled directory (e.g. `examples/fixtures/`) and
# double-check every key in them is a throwaway, not one you actually use.
/wireguard-configs/
